MOSS-LORA
=========

This repository includes vendored third-party code:

  moss_lora/model/moss_image.py
    Source:    https://huggingface.co/OpenMOSS-Team/MOSS-Image-Base/resolve/main/pipeline_moss_image.py
               (also shipped in the OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image repository)
    Revision:  1ceede80badddd6a7812069619edaa5633587192 (model repo state, 2026-10-16)
    License:   Apache-2.0 (upstream repository LICENSE)
    Changes:   documented in the file header: Apache-2.0/provenance comment,
               `import torch.utils.checkpoint`, `gradient_checkpointing` flag plus
               enable/disable methods on MOSSImageTransformer, checkpointed main-block
               loop, and the transformers import moved into
               MOSSImagePipeline.from_components_pretrained so the module imports with
               only torch and diffusers. No math, module structure, state-dict keys,
               scheduler, or pipeline behavior was modified; a unit test diffs the file
               against upstream and allows only these changes.

